        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of a state in a complex and ever-changing world. Every decision you make affects the support of key factions: bureaucrats, capitalists, workers, the military, and others. Monitor the economy, ecology, corruption, crime, and public health. Shape domestic policies and build international relations - from peaceful alliances to cold-blooded confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement reforms, invest in critical sectors, tackle crises, and use diplomatic moves to maintain the nation’s stability. But remember: every choice has consequences, and losing the support of even one powerful group could cost you your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the interests of multiple factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several forms of government affecting gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic, social, and political management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of diplomacy and international relations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices with long-term consequences.</p>",
